Description: Population datasets of Mexico for epidemiological analysis
    and to calculate rates: census population by municipality, sex and age
    group (INEGI ITER 2000, 2010 and 2020), municipal population
    reconstructions and projections 1990-2040 (CONAPO), and population in
    400 m H3 hexagons (Kontur, Humanitarian Data Exchange, 2021-2023), with a
    function to extract the hexagons of urban localities, and a function to
    download the LandScan Global population raster (1 km) on demand.
